{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "54cd1e15-d3b3-8369-bf8b-fc5fcbfe6a48",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T14:19:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:15:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, George Peckham here. Sorry if I'm breaking up, I'm sitting in my car in the lot outside the grocery store and the signal is not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you okay so far. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I got up this morning, did the usual, coffee, walked out to the car, and the rain was just starting, you know, the rain that is hitting today. Anyway, I'm calling about a pothole on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a pothole. Whereabouts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 355 Kay Street, right in front of the house, kind of in the travel lane. [line breaks up] and it's deep. I mean deep enough to swallow a tire. I dropped a wheel in it this morning backing out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out for a second there. You said 355 Kay Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 355 Kay Street. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Three fifty-five Kay Street, pothole in the travel lane, deep enough to take a wheel. And it's filling with water now with the rain, I'd guess?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:17:09-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's filling up, which is the problem, because now you can't even see how deep it is. Somebody's going to get hurt, or at least wreck a rim."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:17:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's what happens. Okay, I'm putting that in as a road hazard so it gets looked at. I'll note it's a deep one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:17:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Um, can I ask, does the city reimburse for car damage? Because my tire was making a noise after I hit it, and I haven't had it checked yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:17:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's a claim process for damage like that. I can't tell you how it'll come out, that goes through a separate office. Usually you'd want to keep your repair estimate or receipts and any photos of the hole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Photos, I can do that, I'll take some before I leave the parking lot, well, when I get home. Who do I go to for the claim?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be the city clerk's office. I can have them reach out to you, or you can call them. I'll put a note on this report that you're asking about damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, please put that on there. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go. I was just going to ask for a reference number for this report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me finish saving it here. [pause] Okay, it's generating. Do you have something to write with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got my phone, I'll type it in the notes. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's PW, dash, 0306, dash, 41. That's P as in Paul, W as in William, zero three zero six, forty-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, zero three zero six, forty-one. Got it. Read that back, PW-0306-41."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:18:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And what's a good number if somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one eight five. Good. I've got George Peckham, 355 Kay Street, deep pothole in the lane, possible vehicle damage noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. How long before somebody gets out there, do you think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "With the rain today, crews are going to be stretched, and patching in wet weather is tricky. But it's logged, and a deep one like that gets priority to at least get marked or cold-patched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, fair enough. I appreciate it, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Drive safe out there, and take those photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T14:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
